{"children": [{"object": "block", "type": "heading_1", "heading_1": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "2026-07-21 (Day 3)"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "heading_2", "heading_2": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "今日主题: its_rom.v + 地址累加器优化 + 完整4x4变换实例"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "divider", "divider": {}}, {"object": "block", "type": "heading_2", "heading_2": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "学到的知识点"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "heading_3", "heading_3": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "ROM 结构"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "ROM = Read-Only Memory, 一块上电后不可改的只读存储器. 存的是VVC标准规定的变换系数"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "its_rom.v: 8176条16-bit系数, 覆盖DCT2(4/8/16/32/64)+DCT8(4/8/16/32)+DST7(4/8/16/32)"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "its_lfnst_rom.v: 8192条16-bit系数, 覆盖16个LFNST场景(nTrs=16/48)"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "rom_coeffs.hex 由 gen_rom_coeffs.py 生成: DCT2用89*cos公式, DCT8/DST7用64*cos/sin公式"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "lfnst_coeffs.hex 由 parse_lfnst_matrices.py 从赛题附件解析"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "ROM读时序: reg[15:0] rom[0:8175]; coeff <= rom[addr]; 发地址后下一拍才出数据(1拍延迟)"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "heading_3", "heading_3": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "ROM 地址映射"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "变换矩阵T是二维(row x col), ROM是一维线性数组. 地址 = base_addr + row*N + col"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "base_addr 由{tr_type, size}查表确定. 例如DCT2-4:base=0; DCT8-4:base=5456; DST7-4:base=6816"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "ROM 布局: DCT2 N=4(16条) -> N=8(64) -> N=16(256) -> N=32(1024) -> N=64(4096) -> DCT8(各size) -> DST7(各size)"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "共8176条. 每个{变换类型x尺寸}组合在ROM里占据连续的 size*size 个地址"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "heading_3", "heading_3": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "500MHz 核心优化: ROM 地址累加器 (TRANSFORM_TIMING_OPT)"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "普通模式(仿真): assign rom_addr = base + (rom_row_idx << size_shift) + pf_rom_col"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "  (rom_row_idx << size_shift) = 桶形移位器, 组合逻辑延迟~0.5ns. 成为500MHz关键路径瓶颈"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "优化模式(综合): reg[13:0] rom_addr_reg; 用累加器替代桶形移位器"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "  90%的拍: rom_addr_reg <= rom_addr_reg + 1 (一个14位加法, 极快)"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "  行切换时: 取预计算好的 next_row_base (不加移位器)"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "  组切换时: 取 prefetch_start_addr"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "  next_row_base = base_addr + ((rom_row_idx+1) << size_shift). 在PREFETCH阶段提前算好"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "  把重活(移位)从时间紧的COMPUTE阶段搬到时间富裕的PREFETCH阶段 -- 关键路径优化核心思想"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "优化结果: ROM地址不在最大setup路径上, WNS从负值收到+0.087ns"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "heading_3", "heading_3": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "pf_dly vs pf_ddly (流水线延迟对齐)"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "PREFETCH阶段做的事: 发ROM地址 -> ROM返回系数 -> 写入coeff_buf. 这三步时序必须对齐"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "普通模式: ROM地址(组合逻辑) -> ROM(1拍) -> coeff->pf_dly(1级对齐) -> 写coeff_buf. 需要1级pf_dly"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "优化模式: 地址先锁进rom_addr_reg(多1拍) -> ROM(1拍) -> coeff->需2级对齐 -> 写coeff_buf"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "  pf_dly 锁存T0的行列号(T1可用), pf_ddly 再锁一次(T2可用). ROM输出系数在T2, 匹配pf_ddly"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "多一级寄存器就多一级延迟链. pf_ddly是rom_addr_reg造成的额外1拍延迟的补偿"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "heading_3", "heading_3": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "定点量化"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "ROM系数是放大取整后的整数而非小数: round(89*cos(...))而非cos(...)"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "每次一维变换后做(+32)>>>6: +32四舍五入, >>>6除以64还原到正确范围"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "为什么是64: VVC标准定标约定. DCT2 DC分量用64, 其他分量用89. 综合定标后每次变换除64"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "DCT8/DST7用64放大, LFNST用128放大. 不同变换不同放大倍数, 但一维变换统一>>6"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "heading_2", "heading_2": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "实例演练: 4x4 DCT2 二维逆变换全过程"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "输入X = [100,20,50,30; 25,10,15,5; 60,40,80,70; 15,35,45,55]"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "变换矩阵T (ROM[0..15]) = [64,64,64,64; 82,34,-34,-82; 63,-63,-63,63; 34,-82,82,-34]"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": ""}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "垂直逆变换 Y = T^T x X (S_ROW, size=tu_height=4):"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "  对每列做N=4一维逆变换. 第0列[100,25,60,15] -> Y[0][0]=12740, Y[1][0]=2240, Y[2][0]=3000, Y[3][0]=7620"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "  Y = [12740,5810,11000,8610; 2240,-3770,-5020,-6830; 3000,1290,1340,1850; 7620,1790,5480,4050]"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "  关键: Y[0][0]=12740 只用了第0列的4个数, 跟第1/2/3列完全无关! 只做垂直变换是不够的"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": ""}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "水平逆变换 Z = Y x T (S_COL, size=tu_width=4):"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "  Z[0][0] = Y[0][0]*T[0][0] + Y[0][1]*T[1][0] + Y[0][2]*T[2][0] + Y[0][3]*T[3][0]"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "          = 12740*64 + 5810*82 + 11000*63 + 8610*34 = 2277520"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "  量化: (2277520+32)>>6 = 35586"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "  Z = [35586,-6033,9857,11550; -11160,13930,433,5757; 6955,-4,3366,1683; 17459,-2012,6464,8569]"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "  Z[0][0] = 4次乘加(水平) x 每Y来自4次乘加(垂直) = 间接关联全部16个X"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": ""}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "总结: 先垂直后水平 = 完整二维变换. 垂直建立列内关联, 水平建立行内关联, 两步后每个Z关联全部16个X"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "共用同一套transform_engine: 垂直时size=tu_height, 水平时size=tu_width, 引擎只看得到列向量"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "T^T(垂直逆变换)和T(水平逆变换)用的系数从ROM不同位置读, 但矩阵值本身通过base_addr和行列遍历自动对应"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "divider", "divider": {}}, {"object": "block", "type": "heading_2", "heading_2": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "系数全部核对完毕"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "DCT2 5种尺寸(5456条) vs VVC标准公式: 0个错误"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "DCT8 4种尺寸(1360条) vs VVC标准公式: 0个错误"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "DST7 4种尺寸(1360条) vs VVC标准公式: 0个错误"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "LFNST 16个场景(8192条) vs 华为赛题原始docx: 0个错误"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "ROM hex文件 原始项目 vs 提交版: 数值0差异(MD5不同仅因注释格式)"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "总计16368个系数全部核实, 无任何错误"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "divider", "divider": {}}, {"object": "block", "type": "heading_2", "heading_2": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "面试可能会问"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "ROM地址怎么从二维(row,col)映射到一维? base_addr + row*N + col"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "为什么ROM地址计算需要优化? 桶形移位器在哪条路径上?"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "累加器怎么替代移位器的? 为什么90%的拍只需要+1?"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "next_row_base什么时候算? 为什么提前算能省时序?"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "pf_ddly比pf_dly多了一级, 为什么? 多出来那拍是哪来的?"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "为什么>>6? +32干什么用的? 不同变换类型放大倍数为什么不同?"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "4x4的反变换全过程, Y[0][0]为什么只跟4个X有关而Z[0][0]跟16个X都有关?"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "先垂直后水平的数学依据? 只做一次为什么不够?"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "你的16368个系数是怎么生成的? 怎么验证正确性的?"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "divider", "divider": {}}, {"object": "block", "type": "heading_2", "heading_2": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "动手做了什么"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "读了its_rom.v(26行)和its_lfnst_rom.v, 理解了reg[15:0]rom[0:8175]语法"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "读了its_transform_engine.v的TRANSFORM_TIMING_OPT代码: 对比了普通模式和累加器模式"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "理解了pf_dly->pf_ddly的两级延迟链和ROM读延迟的对齐关系"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "手算验证了DCT2-4/DCT8-4/DST7-4的ROM系数 vs VVC标准公式"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "追踪了4x4完整二维逆变换: 输入X->垂直Y->水平Z->量化输出的全过程"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "核查了全部16368个系数(ROM+LFNST)与VVC标准/华为附件的一致性"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "divider", "divider": {}}, {"object": "block", "type": "heading_2", "heading_2": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "相关文件"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "02_rtl/rtl/its_rom.v -- 变换核ROM(8176条, 同步读)"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "02_rtl/rtl/its_lfnst_rom.v -- LFNST系数ROM(8192条)"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "02_rtl/rtl/its_transform_engine.v -- TRANSFORM_TIMING_OPT宏(地址累加器优化)"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "02_rtl/rtl/rom_coeffs.hex -- 变换核系数hex文件"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "02_rtl/rtl/lfnst_coeffs.hex -- LFNST系数hex文件"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "03_verification/scripts/gen_rom_coeffs.py -- ROM系数生成脚本"}}]}}, {"object": "block", "type": "bulleted_list_item", "bulleted_list_item": {"rich_text": [{"type": "text", "text": {"content": "03_verification/scripts/ref_model.py -- Python参考模型(同公式)"}}]}}]}